            "line": 292,
            "text": "theorem scale_eq_rpow (c : ℝ) (j : ℕ) {x : ℝ} (hx : 0 < x) :\n    scale c j x = Real.exp (-c / x ^ 2) * x ^ (3 - (j : ℝ))"
